- _resolve-command-opts: --issue-backend space/equals form now rejects a
  missing/empty value or a following flag (was silently swallowing the next
  flag, e.g. `--issue-backend --reason=x`, and falling back to default backend)
- _registry-opts.test: prefix unused handler params with _ (zero-warning lint)
- kernel-issue-cli.test: seed + close two ids so the multi-id close test
  actually exercises the batched fan-out branch
- d20 design doc: correct selector module path to lib/commands/_resolve-command-opts.js
  (default-backend line left as-is pending the kernel-default decision)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
